# ai-guard-demo-LAB: copy to .env beside this compose file (mode 600, gitignored). Owner-set only.
# Real mode: the gateway calls THIS sidecar when the Mock/Real toggle is switched to Real.
# It must be a loopback http URL answering POST /inspect (the demo's /inspect contract, UNVERIFIED).
# The URL is read INSIDE the container, so a sidecar on this Mac is reached at
# host.docker.internal (the server's sidecar-URL check accepts loopback names only in host runs;
# from the container use the host gateway form). Simplest: run the lab from a host checkout
# (npm start) for Real, or point the URL at a sidecar container on the same Docker network.
# Example (host-run lab): AI_GUARD_SIDECAR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7902
# To point Real at an EXTERNAL sidecar on another port (e.g. the demo environment's ML sidecar
# on 127.0.0.1:8086 — a real classifier, not this lab's stand-in), also set:
# AI_GUARD_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_SIDECAR=1
# AI_GUARD_SIDECAR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8086
# Real-by-default for the deployed container: from inside the container, the host's loopback
# sidecar is reached at host.docker.internal (allowed by the same AI_GUARD_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_SIDECAR=1):
#   AI_GUARD_SIDECAR_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8086
# From INSIDE the Docker container 127.0.0.1 is the container itself, so Real-from-Docker
# cannot reach a sidecar published on the host's 127.0.0.1: run the lab from a host checkout
# for Real (npm start with the two variables above). The deployed container stays in Mock
# and its Real toggle is honestly disabled.
# A real classifier can take ~600 ms per call; the demo's gateway timeout default is 1000 ms,
# so raise it in the UI (the gateway settings) if the first calls after idle time out.
# AI_GUARD_SIDECAR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7902
# LAB_ALLOWED_HOSTS=ai-guard-demo.local.ping-devops.com

# Optional: the real PingOne Protect behavioral-risk layer (informs only, never decides; fail-open).
# All three of ENV_ID / WORKER_CLIENT_ID / WORKER_SECRET must be set; REGION defaults to com.
# Values live in this gitignored .env and in Bitwarden.
#PINGONE_PROTECT_ENV_ID=
#PINGONE_PROTECT_WORKER_CLIENT_ID=
#PINGONE_PROTECT_WORKER_SECRET=
#PINGONE_PROTECT_REGION=com
